 What's new in Devpit 0.4

 Accounts is new.
 Tell Devpit once which account a folder uses, and claude, git, gh, vercel,
 firebase, supabase and wrangler use it in that folder by themselves.

 Where things moved
   Git & SSH                       ->  Accounts > Git
   Fix stuck ports, Network tools  ->  Ports & Network
   Install, Update                 ->  Install & Update
   Keys 1-8                        ->  keys 1-6, one per section

 * For AI agents
   Claude Code is on this PC. Devpit has a skill that lets it check which
   account a folder uses and explain why, and it asks you before any change.
   [a] open the AI agent skill screen  nothing is installed until you say yes

 Everything that changed: https://devpit.zubyr.dev/docs/whats-new

